CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract-rec f
^\[f\.precondition\.\d+\] line 1 Check requires clause of contract contract::f for function f: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The generated static minimum is part of a function's code contract, so DFCC
checks it on recursive calls replaced by that contract.
